  "system": {
    "identifier": "uchiha-blazing-rose-chariot",
    "description": "<p>The Uchiha’s secret fire style said to make it rain embers of flame from heaven. You call upon the might of the sun and fire a mote of flame into the air that turns into a flaming bird of your description. It flies into the sky before spreading its wings and exploding releasing what can be described as burning rain.</p>\n<p>Select up to 6 points of your choice within range. The falling flames fall into these spaces and then detonate filling a 10-foot radius sphere with unimaginable heat forcing all creatures in affected areas to make a Constitution saving throw, taking 4d6+4 fire damage, gaining 2 ranks of Burned and being knocked Off-Guard on a failed save.</p>\n<p>Off-Guard. Creatures with Off-Guard cannot spend their reaction in response to this jutsu’s casting or the damage it deals.</p>",
